  "307 A1A2 · Lute Atoms Lead": "A nasal pulse against a quick filtered pluck an octave below; the sparsity swings between a rich tone and a few wavelet atoms, the filtered part of the cycle is swept along it, and LFO 2 thins and thickens the atoms (sparsity).",
